AVLO: persist contourpy's meson-python build tree (backend-flags build-dir=build,
numpy's existing idiom) so the P1.5 group-link harvest can collect the
recorded .o/.a link inputs after the build. Upstreamable one-liner.

diff --git a/packages/contourpy/meta.yaml b/packages/contourpy/meta.yaml
index b3317ca..1a769e8 100644
--- a/packages/contourpy/meta.yaml
+++ b/packages/contourpy/meta.yaml
@@ -8,6 +8,10 @@ source:
   url: https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/source/c/contourpy/contourpy-1.3.3.tar.gz
   sha256: 083e12155b210502d0bca491432bb04d56dc3432f95a979b429f2848c3dbe880
 
+build:
+  backend-flags: |
+    build-dir=build
+
 requirements:
   run:
     - numpy
